#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/restoring_audio_mixing.rst:-1
msgid "Kdenlive Tips & Tricks - Restoring Audio Mixing"
msgstr "Obnovenie mixovania zvuku"

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/restoring_audio_mixing.rst:-1
msgid ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, tips, tricks, tips & tricks, restore, audio mixing, "
"documentation, user manual, video editor, open source, free, learn, easy"
msgstr ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, tipy, triky, tipy a triky, obnoviť, mixovanie zvuku, "
"dokumentácia, používateľská príručka, video editor, open source, zadarmo, "
"naučiť sa, jednoduché"

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/restoring_audio_mixing.rst:16
msgid ""
"This page is not maintained anymore and contains information referring to "
"features or functions from earlier versions of Kdenlive that are deprecated "
"or have been superseded by something else."
msgstr ""
"Táto stránka sa už neudržiava a obsahuje informácie odkazujúce na funkcie "
"alebo možnosti zo starších verzií Kdenlive, ktoré sú zastarané alebo boli "
"nahradené niečím iným."

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/restoring_audio_mixing.rst:19
msgid "Restoring Audio Mixing"
msgstr "Obnovenie mixovania zvuku"

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/restoring_audio_mixing.rst:23
msgid ""
"Nobody is perfect. So yes, once in a while you may experience unexpected odd "
"audio mixing in Kdenlive projects. While audio from some tracks will mix "
"properly, audio from certain other tracks mutes all remaining tracks. "
"Rejoice! Kdenlive 16.08 now comes to your rescue."
msgstr ""
"Nikto nie je dokonalý. Takže áno, občas sa môžete stretnúť s neočakávaným "
"zvláštnym mixovaním zvuku v projektoch Kdenlive. Zatiaľ čo zvuk z niektorých "
"stôp sa zmixuje správne, zvuk z určitých iných stôp stlmí všetky zostávajúce "
"stopy. Radujte sa! Kdenlive 16.08 vám teraz prichádza na pomoc."

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/restoring_audio_mixing.rst:25
msgid "Restoring proper audio mixing is easy:"
msgstr "Obnovenie správneho mixovania zvuku je jednoduché:"

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/restoring_audio_mixing.rst:27
msgid "**Load your project** into Kdenlive"
msgstr "**Načítajte projekt** do Kdenlive"

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/restoring_audio_mixing.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Add a new track** to your timeline; whether it is an audio or video track "
"does not matter"
msgstr ""
"**Pridajte novú stopu** do časovej osi; nezáleží na tom, či ide o zvukovú "
"alebo video stopu"

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/restoring_audio_mixing.rst:29
msgid ""
"Then you may **delete** this track again, if you do not plan to use it anyway"
msgstr ""
"Potom môžete túto stopu znova **odstrániť**, ak ju aj tak neplánujete "
"používať"

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/restoring_audio_mixing.rst:30
msgid "Check playback"
msgstr "Skontrolovať prehrávanie."

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/restoring_audio_mixing.rst:31
msgid "**Save** your project"
msgstr "**Uložte** projekt"

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/restoring_audio_mixing.rst:33
msgid ""
"This may sound exactly like clueless support advice but it works. If you now "
"play your project in the timeline, automatic audio mixing across all "
"timeline tracks should work again normally."
msgstr ""
"Môže to znieť presne ako bezradná rada podpory, ale funguje to. Ak teraz "
"prehráte projekt na časovej osi, automatické mixovanie zvuku naprieč "
"všetkými stopami časovej osi by malo opäť fungovať normálne."

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/restoring_audio_mixing.rst:37
msgid ""
"This upgrades your Kdenlive projects to the most recent project version. So "
"you will not be able to edit it again in an older or ancient Kdenlive "
"version."
msgstr ""
"Toto inovuje vaše projekty Kdenlive na najnovšiu verziu projektu. Preto ho "
"nebudete môcť znova upravovať v staršej alebo dávnej verzii Kdenlive."

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/restoring_audio_mixing.rst:42
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "Poznámky"

